1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,240
Glowing orange lines trace the sleek, angular profile of a massive spaceship into a dark metallic surface.

2
00:00:09,715 --> 00:00:10,412
A glowing fleet takes shape.

3
00:00:20,243 --> 00:00:21,328
Below, silhouettes raise arms in worship.

4
00:00:29,892 --> 00:00:34,500
A towering Vodyani figure glows with bright orange light against a dark metallic wall. It wears sleek armor and bears massive, angular wings made of floating geometric shards.

5
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,000
The wall fades into darkness.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,762
The winged figure fades away.
